# Git and OS metadata
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Dependencies and caches
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/
**/.npm
npm-debug.log*

# Build artifacts
**/dist
**/dist/
**/build
**/build/
**/build-*
**/build-*/
**/CMakeFiles
**/CMakeFiles/
**/CMakeCache.txt
CMakeCache.txt
**/*.tsbuildinfo
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.so
**/*.exe

# Environment & Secrets (NEVER COPY SECRETS)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.cert

# Test & coverage
**/coverage
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output
**/.vitest

# Documentation and temporary files
docs/
scratch/
assests/
landingpage/
